{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"诗篇","commonName":"诗篇","title":"诗篇","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"dbc381a0d937a76da00e224516c540ebdb97b246a5380bed1b67f15a492e5440","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2452},"chapter":{"number":4,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["求助的晚祷"]},{"type":"hebrew_subtitle","content":["大卫的诗，交与伶长。用丝弦的乐器。"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"显我为义的 神啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我呼吁的时候，求你应允我！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我在困苦中，你曾使我宽广；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"现在求你怜恤我，听我的祷告！","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"text":"你们这上流人哪，你们将我的尊荣变为羞辱要到几时呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们喜爱虚妄，寻找虚假，要到几时呢？ （细拉）","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们要知道，耶和华已经分别虔诚人归他自己；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我求告耶和华，他必听我。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"你们应当畏惧，不可犯罪；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在床上的时候，要心里思想，并要肃静。 （细拉）","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"当献上公义的祭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又当倚靠耶和华。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有许多人说：谁能指示我们什么好处？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华啊，求你仰起脸来，光照我们。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你使我心里快乐，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"胜过那丰收五谷新酒的人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"我必安然躺下睡觉，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为独有你—耶和华使我安然居住。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/PSA/4.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/PSA/5.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/PSA/3.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":8}